                                                "sense_id": "d91972c5-1d47-3ca2-95bb-864231ccdf12",
                                                "text": "Recently, one early GPT-4 tester — who was bound by a nondisclosure agreement with OpenAI but gossiped a little anyway — told me that testing GPT-4 had caused the person to have an “existential crisis,” because it revealed how powerful and creative the A.I. was compared with the tester’s own puny brain."
